---
description: Parmar CRM project rules — always apply
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `brain/00-START-HERE.md` before writing any code in this repo, then
`brain/02-system-design.md` and `brain/04-access-control.md`.

Hard rules:
- Never invent tables or columns. If it is not in `brain/03-data-model.md`, it does not exist.
- Never change the database from the Supabase dashboard. Migrations only — see `brain/workflow/migrations.md`.
- Never use the service_role key in application code. RLS is the security boundary.
- Never guess business rules (working hours, SLA timings, permissions). They are written down. Ask if missing.
- Always pull main before branching. See `brain/workflow/git-practices.md`.

Log finished work in `brain/team/<developer>.md`.
